{"paragraphs":[{"text":"%md\n# Ref. ‘4.2 Importering og Klargjøring av Data’ in report\n## Detailed notebook on data handeling of Capstone data.\nIn this notebook we'll go in details through each step which has been taken to create the complete dataframe which we have used to build our Cassandra enviroment and CQL queries around.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-12-11T23:28:44+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h1>Ref. ‘4.2 Importering og Klargjøring av Data’ in report</h1>\n<h2>Detailed notebook on data handeling of Capstone data.</h2>\n<p>In this notebook we&rsquo;ll go in details through each step which has been taken to create the complete dataframe which we have used to build our Cassandra enviroment and CQL queries around.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1765482462846_678896727","id":"paragraph_1762714528079_1297707509","dateCreated":"2025-12-11T19:47:42+0000","status":"FINISHED","focus":true,"dateFinished":"2025-12-11T23:28:48+0000","dateStarted":"2025-12-11T23:28:44+0000"},{"text":"%md\n## Ref. '4.2.1 Overordnet Konfigurering av Zeppelin Notatbok' in report\n### Import packages and set local time.\nSince these files are oriententet around Norwegian timezone, we configure this note book to opreate with the timezone \"Europe/Oslo\". This will make the `TimestampType` give the right time allocation for Timestamp data.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-12-11T23:28:48+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h2>Ref. &lsquo;4.2.1 Overordnet Konfigurering av Zeppelin Notatbok&rsquo; in report</h2>\n<h3>Import packages and set local time.</h3>\n<p>Since these files are oriententet around Norwegian timezone, we configure this note book to opreate with the timezone &ldquo;Europe/Oslo&rdquo;. This will make the <code>TimestampType</code> give the right time allocation for Timestamp data.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1765482462848_2008045346","id":"paragraph_1762797225883_263168143","dateCreated":"2025-12-11T19:47:42+0000","status":"FINISHED","dateFinished":"2025-12-11T23:28:48+0000","dateStarted":"2025-12-11T23:28:48+0000"},{"text":"%spark\r\nimport spark.implicits._\r\nimport org.apache.spark.sql.types._\r\nimport org.apache.spark.sql.expressions._\r\nimport org.apache.spark.sql.functions._ \r\n\r\n// Sett timezone to NO\r\nspark.conf.set(\"spark.sql.session.timeZone\", \"Europe/Oslo\")\r\n","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-12-11T23:28:48+0000","progress":0,"config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"scala","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"TEXT","data":"import spark.implicits._\nimport org.apache.spark.sql.types._\nimport org.apache.spark.sql.expressions._\nimport org.apache.spark.sql.functions._\n"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1765482462849_742608128","id":"paragraph_1762714155530_1600241643","dateCreated":"2025-12-11T19:47:42+0000","status":"FINISHED","dateFinished":"2025-12-11T23:28:53+0000","dateStarted":"2025-12-11T23:28:48+0000"},{"text":"%md\n## Ref. '4.2.2 Data Kilder' in report\n### Define data source locations.\nFirst we'll define the location of the different datasets we're going to import.  \nAll data files used in this project is collected from `.csv` files.  \nThis will be defined with several relative paths. Meaning that that there are different paths to different sources, but their all confined within the `sparkio` local enviroment directory.  \nFile import will be done recursively, so each source path is defined with `*.csv` at the lowest level to include all csv files in the given path.  \n","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-12-11T23:28:53+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h2>Ref. &lsquo;4.2.2 Data Kilder&rsquo; in report</h2>\n<h3>Define data source locations.</h3>\n<p>First we&rsquo;ll define the location of the different datasets we&rsquo;re going to import.<br />\nAll data files used in this project is collected from <code>.csv</code> files.<br />\nThis will be defined with several relative paths. Meaning that that there are different paths to different sources, but their all confined within the <code>sparkio</code> local enviroment directory.<br />\nFile import will be done recursively, so each source path is defined with <code>*.csv</code> at the lowest level to include all csv files in the given path.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1765482462849_806548516","id":"paragraph_1762797397299_806898811","dateCreated":"2025-12-11T19:47:42+0000","status":"FINISHED","dateFinished":"2025-12-11T23:28:53+0000","dateStarted":"2025-12-11T23:28:53+0000"},{"text":"%spark\nval bil_base = \"/sparkio/trafikkdata/bil/*.csv\"\nval sykkel_base = \"/sparkio/trafikkdata/sykkel/*.csv\"\nval weather_base = \"/sparkio/værdata/*.csv\"","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-12-11T23:28:53+0000","progress":0,"config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"scala","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"TEXT","data":"\u001b[1m\u001b[34mbil_base\u001b[0m: \u001b[1m\u001b[32mString\u001b[0m = /sparkio/trafikkdata/bil/*.csv\n\u001b[1m\u001b[34msykkel_base\u001b[0m: \u001b[1m\u001b[32mString\u001b[0m = /sparkio/trafikkdata/sykkel/*.csv\n\u001b[1m\u001b[34mweather_base\u001b[0m: \u001b[1m\u001b[32mString\u001b[0m = /sparkio/værdata/*.csv\n"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1765482462850_384761187","id":"paragraph_1762875517429_549992018","dateCreated":"2025-12-11T19:47:42+0000","status":"FINISHED","dateFinished":"2025-12-11T23:28:54+0000","dateStarted":"2025-12-11T23:28:53+0000"},{"text":"%md\n## Ref. '4.2.3 Schema – Definering av datastruktur' in report\n### Build Schema for Dataframes.\nSince we're importing csv files it's necessary to predifine **Schemas** for the different imports.  \nWe'll create one schmea for trafic related files, since they all have the same data structure.  \nWe'll create a separate schema for weather data.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-12-11T23:28:54+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h2>Ref. &lsquo;4.2.3 Schema – Definering av datastruktur&rsquo; in report</h2>\n<h3>Build Schema for Dataframes.</h3>\n<p>Since we&rsquo;re importing csv files it&rsquo;s necessary to predifine <strong>Schemas</strong> for the different imports.<br />\nWe&rsquo;ll create one schmea for trafic related files, since they all have the same data structure.<br />\nWe&rsquo;ll create a separate schema for weather data.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1765482462851_389727609","id":"paragraph_1762875573880_238515049","dateCreated":"2025-12-11T19:47:42+0000","status":"FINISHED","dateFinished":"2025-12-11T23:28:54+0000","dateStarted":"2025-12-11T23:28:54+0000"},{"text":"%spark\nval trafikk_Schema = StructType(Array(\n    StructField(\"trafikkregistreringspunkt\", StringType, true),\n\tStructField(\"navn\", StringType, true),\n\tStructField(\"vegreferanse\", StringType, true),\n\tStructField(\"fra\", TimestampType, true),\n\tStructField(\"til\", TimestampType, true),\n\tStructField(\"dato\", DateType, true),\n\tStructField(\"fra tidspunkt\", StringType, true),\n\tStructField(\"til tidspunkt\", StringType, true),\n\tStructField(\"felt\", StringType, true),\n\tStructField(\"trafikkmengde\", ShortType, true),\n\tStructField(\"dekningsgrad (%)\", StringType, true),\n\tStructField(\"antall timer total\", ByteType, true),\n\tStructField(\"antall timer inkludert\", ByteType, true),\n\tStructField(\"antall timer ugyldig\", ByteType, true),\n\tStructField(\"ikke gyldig lengde\", ByteType, true),\n\tStructField(\"lengdekvalitetsgrad (%)\", StringType, true),\n\tStructField(\"< 5,6m\", ShortType, true),\n\tStructField(\">= 5,6m\", ShortType, true),\n\tStructField(\"5,6m - 7,6m\", ShortType, true),\n\tStructField(\"7,6m - 12,5m\", ShortType, true),\n\tStructField(\"12,5m - 16,0m\", ShortType, true),\n\tStructField(\">= 16,0m\", ShortType, true),\n\tStructField(\"16,0m - 24,0m\", ShortType, true),\n\tStructField(\">= 24,0m\", ShortType, true)\n))\n\nval weather_Schema = StructType(Array(\n    StructField(\"navn\", StringType, true),\n\tStructField(\"stasjon\", StringType, true),\n\tStructField(\"tid(norsk normaltid)\", TimestampType, true),\n\tStructField(\"nedbør (1 t)\", StringType, true),\n\tStructField(\"lufttemperatur\", StringType, true),\n    StructField(\"Antall minutter nedbør siste time\", StringType, true),\n\tStructField(\"høyeste middelvind (1 t)\", StringType, true)\n))","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-12-11T23:28:54+0000","progress":0,"config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"scala","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"TEXT","data":"\u001b[1m\u001b[34mtrafikk_Schema\u001b[0m: \u001b[1m\u001b[32morg.apache.spark.sql.types.StructType\u001b[0m = StructType(StructField(trafikkregistreringspunkt,StringType,true),StructField(navn,StringType,true),StructField(vegreferanse,StringType,true),StructField(fra,TimestampType,true),StructField(til,TimestampType,true),StructField(dato,DateType,true),StructField(fra tidspunkt,StringType,true),StructField(til tidspunkt,StringType,true),StructField(felt,StringType,true),StructField(trafikkmengde,ShortType,true),StructField(dekningsgrad (%),StringType,true),StructField(antall timer total,ByteType,true),StructField(antall timer inkludert,ByteType,true),StructField(antall timer ugyldig,ByteType,true),StructField(ikke gyldig lengde,ByteType,true),StructField(lengdekvalitetsgrad (%),StringType,true),StructField(< 5,6m...\n"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1765482462851_1335033898","id":"paragraph_1762719376207_1791722203","dateCreated":"2025-12-11T19:47:42+0000","status":"FINISHED","dateFinished":"2025-12-11T23:28:56+0000","dateStarted":"2025-12-11T23:28:54+0000"},{"text":"%md\n## Ref. '4.2.4 Import av Data' in report\n### Importing Data\nThis import job does the following:\n- Use the CSV header to name columns.\n- Recursively import a bundle of CSV datafiles.\n- Defines datatypes based on predefined Schema.\n- Defines the delimiter which separates data in CSV files.\n- Defines datacells with '-' as `NULL` values.\n- Defines the format of `timestampTypes`.\n- Import data from predefined file locations.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-12-11T23:28:56+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h2>Ref. &lsquo;4.2.4 Import av Data&rsquo; in report</h2>\n<h3>Importing Data</h3>\n<p>This import job does the following:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Use the CSV header to name columns.</li>\n<li>Recursively import a bundle of CSV datafiles.</li>\n<li>Defines datatypes based on predefined Schema.</li>\n<li>Defines the delimiter which separates data in CSV files.</li>\n<li>Defines datacells with &lsquo;-&rsquo; as <code>NULL</code> values.</li>\n<li>Defines the format of <code>timestampTypes</code>.</li>\n<li>Import data from predefined file locations.</li>\n</ul>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1765482462852_1259006701","id":"paragraph_1762880257361_1153084816","dateCreated":"2025-12-11T19:47:42+0000","status":"FINISHED","dateFinished":"2025-12-11T23:28:56+0000","dateStarted":"2025-12-11T23:28:56+0000"},{"text":"%spark\nval bil_raw_df = spark.read\n    .option(\"header\", true)\n    .option(\"recursiveFileLookup\", true)\n    .schema(trafikk_Schema)\n    .option(\"delimiter\", \";\")\n    .option(\"nullValue\", \"-\")\n    .option(\"timestampFormat\", \"yyyy-MM-dd'T'HH:mmXXX\")    \n    .csv(bil_base)\n\nval sykkel_raw_df = spark.read\n    .option(\"header\", true)\n    .option(\"recursiveFileLookup\", true)\n    .schema(trafikk_Schema)\n    .option(\"delimiter\", \";\")\n    .option(\"nullValue\", \"-\")\n    .option(\"timestampFormat\", \"yyyy-MM-dd'T'HH:mmXXX\")    \n    .csv(sykkel_base)\n\nval weather_raw_df = spark.read\n    .option(\"header\", true)\n    .option(\"recursiveFileLookup\", true)\n    .schema(weather_Schema)\n    .option(\"delimiter\", \";\")\n    .option(\"nullValue\", \"-\")\n    .option(\"timestampFormat\", \"dd.MM.yyyy HH:mm\")\n    .csv(weather_base)\n\nval bil_raw = bil_raw_df.withColumn(\"klasse\", lit(0).cast(ByteType))\nval sykkel_raw = sykkel_raw_df.withColumn(\"klasse\", lit(1).cast(ByteType))","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-12-11T23:28:56+0000","progress":0,"config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"scala","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"TEXT","data":"\u001b[1m\u001b[34mbil_raw_df\u001b[0m: \u001b[1m\u001b[32morg.apache.spark.sql.DataFrame\u001b[0m = [trafikkregistreringspunkt: string, navn: string ... 22 more fields]\n\u001b[1m\u001b[34msykkel_raw_df\u001b[0m: \u001b[1m\u001b[32morg.apache.spark.sql.DataFrame\u001b[0m = [trafikkregistreringspunkt: string, navn: string ... 22 more fields]\n\u001b[1m\u001b[34mweather_raw_df\u001b[0m: \u001b[1m\u001b[32morg.apache.spark.sql.DataFrame\u001b[0m = [navn: string, stasjon: string ... 5 more fields]\n\u001b[1m\u001b[34mbil_raw\u001b[0m: \u001b[1m\u001b[32morg.apache.spark.sql.DataFrame\u001b[0m = [trafikkregistreringspunkt: string, navn: string ... 23 more fields]\n\u001b[1m\u001b[34msykkel_raw\u001b[0m: \u001b[1m\u001b[32morg.apache.spark.sql.DataFrame\u001b[0m = [trafikkregistreringspunkt: string, navn: string ... 23 more fields]\n"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1765482462852_1618563379","id":"paragraph_1762720776688_657134370","dateCreated":"2025-12-11T19:47:42+0000","status":"FINISHED","dateFinished":"2025-12-11T23:28:59+0000","dateStarted":"2025-12-11T23:28:56+0000"},{"text":"%md\n## Ref. '4.2.5 Fjerning av duplikater' in report\n### Removing Duplicates\nHere we remove all duplicate rows on all the dataset before the datasets are combined.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-12-11T23:28:59+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h2>Ref. &lsquo;4.2.5 Fjerning av duplikater&rsquo; in report</h2>\n<h3>Removing Duplicates</h3>\n<p>Here we remove all duplicate rows on all the dataset before the datasets are combined.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1765482462852_1585072257","id":"paragraph_1762987617533_978316632","dateCreated":"2025-12-11T19:47:42+0000","status":"FINISHED","dateFinished":"2025-12-11T23:28:59+0000","dateStarted":"2025-12-11T23:28:59+0000"},{"text":"%spark\nval bil_rm_dup = bil_raw.dropDuplicates()\nval sykkel_rm_dup = sykkel_raw.dropDuplicates()\nval weather_rm_dup = weather_raw_df.dropDuplicates()","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-12-11T23:28:59+0000","progress":0,"config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"scala","editOnDblClick":false,"completionSupport":true,"completionKey":"TAB"},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"TEXT","data":"\u001b[1m\u001b[34mbil_rm_dup\u001b[0m: \u001b[1m\u001b[32morg.apache.spark.sql.Dataset[org.apache.spark.sql.Row]\u001b[0m = [trafikkregistreringspunkt: string, navn: string ... 23 more fields]\n\u001b[1m\u001b[34msykkel_rm_dup\u001b[0m: \u001b[1m\u001b[32morg.apache.spark.sql.Dataset[org.apache.spark.sql.Row]\u001b[0m = [trafikkregistreringspunkt: string, navn: string ... 23 more fields]\n\u001b[1m\u001b[34mweather_rm_dup\u001b[0m: \u001b[1m\u001b[32morg.apache.spark.sql.Dataset[org.apache.spark.sql.Row]\u001b[0m = [navn: string, stasjon: string ... 5 more fields]\n"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1765482462852_1838839055","id":"paragraph_1762987756866_866523670","dateCreated":"2025-12-11T19:47:42+0000","status":"FINISHED","dateFinished":"2025-12-11T23:29:01+0000","dateStarted":"2025-12-11T23:28:59+0000"},{"text":"%md\n## Ref. '4.2.6 Sammensetting av Trafikk Dataframes' in report\n### Combining Trafic Data\nHere we combine the rows of `bil_raw` and `sykkel_raw` into one single dataframe (`trafikk_raw_df`) with the **union** method.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-12-11T23:29:01+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h2>Ref. &lsquo;4.2.6 Sammensetting av Trafikk Dataframes&rsquo; in report</h2>\n<h3>Combining Trafic Data</h3>\n<p>Here we combine the rows of <code>bil_raw</code> and <code>sykkel_raw</code> into one single dataframe (<code>trafikk_raw_df</code>) with the <strong>union</strong> method.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1765482462852_1104903229","id":"paragraph_1762883365119_2141439142","dateCreated":"2025-12-11T19:47:42+0000","status":"FINISHED","dateFinished":"2025-12-11T23:29:01+0000","dateStarted":"2025-12-11T23:29:01+0000"},{"text":"%spark\nval trafikk_raw_df = bil_rm_dup.union(sykkel_rm_dup)","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-12-11T23:29:01+0000","progress":0,"config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"scala","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"TEXT","data":"\u001b[1m\u001b[34mtrafikk_raw_df\u001b[0m: \u001b[1m\u001b[32morg.apache.spark.sql.Dataset[org.apache.spark.sql.Row]\u001b[0m = [trafikkregistreringspunkt: string, navn: string ... 23 more fields]\n"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1765482462853_1845672794","id":"paragraph_1762791573296_1357469793","dateCreated":"2025-12-11T19:47:42+0000","status":"FINISHED","dateFinished":"2025-12-11T23:29:02+0000","dateStarted":"2025-12-11T23:29:01+0000"},{"text":"%md\n### Simple validation of content.\nBelow we're preforming a simple count to validate that the number of rows in new dataframe corresponds with the two separate dataframes.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-12-11T23:29:02+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h3>Simple validation of content.</h3>\n<p>Below we&rsquo;re preforming a simple count to validate that the number of rows in new dataframe corresponds with the two separate dataframes.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1765482462853_363399077","id":"paragraph_1762883589529_116530362","dateCreated":"2025-12-11T19:47:42+0000","status":"FINISHED","dateFinished":"2025-12-11T23:29:02+0000","dateStarted":"2025-12-11T23:29:02+0000"},{"text":"%spark\nprint(\"count: bil_df+sykkel_df\\n\")\nprint(bil_rm_dup.count() + sykkel_rm_dup.count())\nprint(\"\\ncount: combined_df\\n\")\nprint(trafikk_raw_df.count())","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-12-11T23:29:02+0000","progress":0,"config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"scala","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"TEXT","data":"count: bil_df+sykkel_df\n2189107\ncount: combined_df\n2189107"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{"jobUrl":{"propertyName":"jobUrl","label":"SPARK JOB","tooltip":"View in Spark web UI","group":"spark","values":[{"jobUrl":"http://localhost:4040/jobs/job?id=15"},{"jobUrl":"http://localhost:4040/jobs/job?id=16"},{"jobUrl":"http://localhost:4040/jobs/job?id=17"},{"jobUrl":"http://localhost:4040/jobs/job?id=18"},{"jobUrl":"http://localhost:4040/jobs/job?id=19"},{"jobUrl":"http://localhost:4040/jobs/job?id=20"},{"jobUrl":"http://localhost:4040/jobs/job?id=21"},{"jobUrl":"http://localhost:4040/jobs/job?id=22"},{"jobUrl":"http://localhost:4040/jobs/job?id=23"},{"jobUrl":"http://localhost:4040/jobs/job?id=24"}],"interpreterSettingId":"spark"}},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1765482462853_114414358","id":"paragraph_1762792329300_1133269017","dateCreated":"2025-12-11T19:47:42+0000","status":"FINISHED","dateFinished":"2025-12-11T23:29:39+0000","dateStarted":"2025-12-11T23:29:02+0000"},{"text":"%md\n## Ref. '4.2.7 Behandling av Importert Data' in report\n### Handle Value Formats\nWith the use of `withColumn` and `regexp_replace` methods we're correcting the values in need of it and cast is to the corret dataType.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-12-12T01:35:26+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h2>Ref. &lsquo;4.2.7 Behandling av Importert Data&rsquo; in report</h2>\n<h3>Handle Value Formats</h3>\n<p>With the use of <code>withColumn</code> and <code>regexp_replace</code> methods we&rsquo;re correcting the values in need of it and cast is to the corret dataType.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1765482462853_1636175604","id":"paragraph_1762885219539_1971529294","dateCreated":"2025-12-11T19:47:42+0000","status":"FINISHED","dateFinished":"2025-12-12T01:35:26+0000","dateStarted":"2025-12-12T01:35:26+0000","focus":true},{"text":"%md\n## Ref. '4.2.10.1 Regex Replace' in report\n### Benchmark for replace function\nHere there has been implemented a `time` function which has been used to compare the processing time between `replace` and `regexp_replace`. This benchmark test is furter documented in the appended report.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-12-12T01:35:35+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1765503115771_80816717","id":"paragraph_1765503115771_80816717","dateCreated":"2025-12-12T01:31:55+0000","status":"FINISHED","focus":true,"dateFinished":"2025-12-12T01:35:35+0000","dateStarted":"2025-12-12T01:35:35+0000","results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h2>Ref. &lsquo;4.2.10.1 Regex Replace&rsquo; in report</h2>\n<h3>Benchmark for replace function</h3>\n<p>Here there has been implemented a <code>time</code> function which has been used to compare the processing time between <code>replace</code> and <code>regexp_replace</code>. This benchmark test is furter documented in the appended report.</p>\n\n</div>"}]}},{"text":"%spark\nspark.time {\nval trafikk_df_formatFix = trafikk_raw_df\n    .withColumn(\n        \"dekningsgrad (%)\",\n        replace(col(\"dekningsgrad (%)\"), lit(\",\"), lit(\".\")).cast(FloatType)\n    )\n    .withColumn(\n        \"lengdekvalitetsgrad (%)\",\n        replace(col(\"lengdekvalitetsgrad (%)\"), lit(\",\"), lit(\".\")).cast(FloatType)\n    )\n    .withColumn(\n        \"navn\",\n        trim(replace(col(\"navn\"), lit(\" sykkel\"), lit(\"\")))\n    )\n    .withColumn(\n        \"fra tidspunkt\",\n        date_format(col(\"fra\"), \"k\").cast(\"byte\")\n    )\n    .withColumn(\n        \"til tidspunkt\",\n        date_format(col(\"til\"), \"k\").cast(\"byte\")\n    )\n    \n    trafikk_df_formatFix.count()\n}\nspark.time {\nval weather_df_formatfix = weather_rm_dup\n    .withColumn(\n        \"nedbør (1 t)\",\n        replace(col(\"nedbør (1 t)\"), lit(\",\"), lit(\".\")).cast(FloatType)\n    )\n    .withColumn(\n        \"lufttemperatur\",\n        replace(col(\"lufttemperatur\"), lit(\",\"), lit(\".\")).cast(FloatType)\n    )\n    .withColumn(\n        \"høyeste middelvind (1 t)\",\n        replace(col(\"høyeste middelvind (1 t)\"), lit(\",\"), lit(\".\")).cast(FloatType)\n    )\n    \n    weather_df_formatfix.count()\n}","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-12-12T01:35:33+0000","progress":0,"config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"scala","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"TEXT","data":"Time taken: 18245 ms\nTime taken: 1064 ms\n\u001b[1m\u001b[34mres27\u001b[0m: \u001b[1m\u001b[32mLong\u001b[0m = 174715\n"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{"jobUrl":{"propertyName":"jobUrl","label":"SPARK JOB","tooltip":"View in Spark web UI","group":"spark","values":[{"jobUrl":"http://localhost:4040/jobs/job?id=135"},{"jobUrl":"http://localhost:4040/jobs/job?id=136"},{"jobUrl":"http://localhost:4040/jobs/job?id=137"},{"jobUrl":"http://localhost:4040/jobs/job?id=138"},{"jobUrl":"http://localhost:4040/jobs/job?id=139"},{"jobUrl":"http://localhost:4040/jobs/job?id=140"},{"jobUrl":"http://localhost:4040/jobs/job?id=141"}],"interpreterSettingId":"spark"}},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1765482462853_1397991752","id":"paragraph_1762795723928_110875404","dateCreated":"2025-12-11T19:47:42+0000","status":"FINISHED","dateFinished":"2025-12-12T01:31:37+0000","dateStarted":"2025-12-12T01:31:16+0000","focus":false},{"text":"%md\n## Ref. '4.2.8 Sammensetting av Trafikk og Værdata' in report\n### Final join operation to create a Final df\nHere we perform the final join operation between trafic and weather data to get a final complete df which will be used to build the Cassandra database.  \nSome columns from the weather df has been exluded here. This has been justified in further detail in the appended report.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-12-11T23:29:41+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h2>Ref. &lsquo;4.2.8 Sammensetting av Trafikk og Værdata&rsquo; in report</h2>\n<h3>Final join operation to create a Final df</h3>\n<p>Here we perform the final join operation between trafic and weather data to get a final complete df which will be used to build the Cassandra database.<br />\nSome columns from the weather df has been exluded here. This has been justified in further detail in the appended report.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1765482462854_1960196921","id":"paragraph_1762893643169_1841534975","dateCreated":"2025-12-11T19:47:42+0000","status":"FINISHED","dateFinished":"2025-12-11T23:29:41+0000","dateStarted":"2025-12-11T23:29:41+0000"},{"text":"%spark\nval complete_df_raw = trafikk_df_formatFix.alias(\"c\")\n    .join(weather_df_formatfix.alias(\"w\"),\n        col(\"c.fra\") === col(\"w.tid(norsk normaltid)\"),\"left\")\n    .select(\n        col(\"c.*\"),\n        col(\"w.lufttemperatur\"),\n        col(\"w.høyeste middelvind (1 t)\").as(\"høyeste middelvind (m/s)\")\n    )","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-12-11T23:29:41+0000","progress":0,"config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"scala","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"TEXT","data":"\u001b[1m\u001b[34mcomplete_df_raw\u001b[0m: \u001b[1m\u001b[32morg.apache.spark.sql.DataFrame\u001b[0m = [trafikkregistreringspunkt: string, navn: string ... 25 more fields]\n"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1765482462854_680562535","id":"paragraph_1762892671307_806442058","dateCreated":"2025-12-11T19:47:42+0000","status":"FINISHED","dateFinished":"2025-12-11T23:29:43+0000","dateStarted":"2025-12-11T23:29:41+0000"},{"text":"%md\n## Ref. '4.2.9 Vurdering av Uppassende eller Ukorrekt Data' in report\n### Validation of content for Final df\nAs a final step before we can consider the final df to be production ready we'll go throught som validation steps regarding the quality of the data. More details about these steps can be found in the report.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-12-11T23:29:43+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h2>Ref. &lsquo;4.2.9 Vurdering av Uppassende eller Ukorrekt Data&rsquo; in report</h2>\n<h3>Validation of content for Final df</h3>\n<p>As a final step before we can consider the final df to be production ready we&rsquo;ll go throught som validation steps regarding the quality of the data. More details about these steps can be found in the report.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1765482462854_1820055088","id":"paragraph_1762965469519_1681055831","dateCreated":"2025-12-11T19:47:42+0000","status":"FINISHED","dateFinished":"2025-12-11T23:29:43+0000","dateStarted":"2025-12-11T23:29:43+0000"},{"text":"%md\n### Dekningsgrad (%)\nRemoves rows where:\n- `dekningsgrad (%)` === 0\n- `trafikkmengde` not **NULL**","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-12-11T23:29:43+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h3>Dekningsgrad (%)</h3>\n<p>Removes rows where:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>dekningsgrad (%)</code> === 0</li>\n<li><code>trafikkmengde</code> not <strong>NULL</strong></li>\n</ul>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1765482462854_683558245","id":"paragraph_1762965664711_115253435","dateCreated":"2025-12-11T19:47:42+0000","status":"FINISHED","dateFinished":"2025-12-11T23:29:43+0000","dateStarted":"2025-12-11T23:29:43+0000"},{"text":"%spark\nval validation = complete_df_raw\n    .filter( ! (col(\"dekningsgrad (%)\") === 0\n    &&\n    col(\"trafikkmengde\").isNotNull))","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-12-11T23:29:43+0000","progress":0,"config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"scala","editOnDblClick":false,"completionSupport":true,"completionKey":"TAB"},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"TEXT","data":"\u001b[1m\u001b[34mvalidation\u001b[0m: \u001b[1m\u001b[32morg.apache.spark.sql.Dataset[org.apache.spark.sql.Row]\u001b[0m = [trafikkregistreringspunkt: string, navn: string ... 25 more fields]\n"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1765482462854_89512556","id":"paragraph_1762965893395_996477836","dateCreated":"2025-12-11T19:47:42+0000","status":"FINISHED","dateFinished":"2025-12-11T23:29:45+0000","dateStarted":"2025-12-11T23:29:43+0000"},{"text":"%md\n### Lengdekvalitetsgrad (%)\nRemoves rows where:\n- `lengdekvalitetsgrad (%)` === 0\n- `trafikkmengde` not **NULL**\n- `klasse` === 0","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-12-11T23:29:45+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h3>Lengdekvalitetsgrad (%)</h3>\n<p>Removes rows where:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>lengdekvalitetsgrad (%)</code> === 0</li>\n<li><code>trafikkmengde</code> not <strong>NULL</strong></li>\n<li><code>klasse</code> === 0</li>\n</ul>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1765482462854_1994819034","id":"paragraph_1762966512912_1459790014","dateCreated":"2025-12-11T19:47:42+0000","status":"FINISHED","dateFinished":"2025-12-11T23:29:45+0000","dateStarted":"2025-12-11T23:29:45+0000"},{"text":"%spark\nval complete_df = validation\n    .filter( ! (col(\"Lengdekvalitetsgrad (%)\") === 0\n    &&\n    col(\"trafikkmengde\").isNotNull\n    &&\n    col(\"klasse\") === 0))","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-12-11T23:29:45+0000","progress":0,"config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"scala","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHi